        "subtitle_size": 12,
        "body_size": 16,
        "animation_style": "fade-up",
        "heading_position": "top",
        "subtitle": "",
        "top_label": "",
        "top_url": "",
        "top_button_style": "button",
        "body": "<p>Initials and names give customers a simple way to make everyday jewelry their own. Explore letter pendants, nameplate necklaces, monogram charms and coordinated bracelet or earring designs for your next collection.</p><p>We can discuss letterform direction, size, metal choices, surface finishes and stone accents, then develop samples to evaluate proportions and wearability before production.</p>",
        "image": "",
        "image_position": "right",
        "image_ratio": "landscape",
        "cta_label": "Explore Initial Jewelry Development",
        "cta_url": "shopify://pages/contact",
        "cta_button_style": "button-unstyled",
