        "heading_position": "top",
        "subtitle": "",
        "top_label": "",
        "top_url": "",
        "top_button_style": "button",
        "body": "<p>Birthstone jewelry connects color and personal meaning with timeless gift appeal. Create gemstone-focused pendants, stacking rings, earrings and charms around birth months or your brand’s own color story.</p><p>Choose shapes, settings and material directions that suit your collection. Final stone availability and specifications can be confirmed during development and sampling.</p>",
